# Prompt
Please create an implementation of the SVIFile interface.

Additional guidelines:
* When creating constructor, don't make its 'data' parameter mandatory.
If not set, let attributes be undefined. In this case, they will be filled
in later.
* To resolve path, please use the resolvePath function from pathResolver.ts
* Please use the 'path' library for other relevant operations, don't try
to write the algorithm from scratch
This ensures working of production code and tests in various environments 
(windows, linux, mac).
* constructor of SviFileClass should have no mandatory parameters.
* Please generate class so that to avoid errors like incompatible types, and others.
(e.g., if a method SVIFile interface return string, don't return string | undefined)
in the corresponding implemented method.
* Recommended import for Config:
```typescript
import { Config } from "../config/config";
```

Algorithm of getSviFileRelativePath():
* Get config instance by using Config.getInstance() from ../config/config.ts
* Use function getRelativePath from ../utils/file.ts passing this.filePath 
and config.dir as base path